AUDIT-REPORT*
*:Zone.Identifier

# Raw Playwright/axe runner output: 4+ MB per run, regenerated by re-running the
# suite, and no .log was ever tracked. The durable record is
# evidence/LOCAL-AGENT-RESULTS/TEST-RESULTS.txt plus RUN-SUMMARY.md.
evidence/**/*.log
